WEBVTT

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.326
We did it!

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.629
I can smell it...

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.163
The smell of blood!

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:08.775
Which one of you is the survivor?

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:09.476
Smell of blood, smell of blood...
Which one of you is the survivor?

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:10.909
Smell of blood, smell of blood...

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.935
Damn it, it's messing with us.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:15.573
Hey, rookies!
Go and call for back up, quick!

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.173
And don't forget the shotguns!

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.479
Y-Yes, sir!

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.012
Shindo!

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:27.360
There, he's the one.

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:30.488
Kill him.
Kill all of the survivors.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:35.490
Why are you talking nonsense,
you monster!?

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.728
It's no use...

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.165
No matter how many bullets
you fire at it,

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.240
the people that have been taken over
by them won't die...

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.675
until you cut the faces off
of their bodies.

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:35.918
Dream

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.733
S-Swords!?

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:02.180
Hey, who in the world
are you guys!?

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.323
Hey! What the hell are you-

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.554
Okay now, good work,
division one!

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:18.394
Good job, you can go back now.

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.592
Division two
will take care of the rest.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:22.826
SpecSec...

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:30.599
Why you... I won't let you get away
with whatever you want!

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.020
Is there any sign
of Number Twelve?

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:44.523
No... we cannot confirm

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:47.651
an atmospheric ion density
singularity in the local area.

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:50.424
Damn, just the bugs, huh?

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:51.760
Don't get careless.

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:55.063
Widen the search area,
centered on the gate.

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.261
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:56.302 --> 00:03:59.635
And completely seal off
the surrounding area.

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:02.038
Don't let even a cat get through.

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:06.070
Announce to the press
that this was a fight

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.204
between drug dealers.

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:08.236
Hey.

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.270
Hurry!

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:11.215
Hey, can't you hear me!?

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:14.049
What in the world
are you guys up to!?

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.679
Chief, you mustn't!

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:17.019
She's a lieutenant...

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:18.717
Shut up!

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:21.192
It doesn't matter to me
if she's a lieutenant or whatever,

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.751
but I've lost one guy
from my team

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:24.558
and four people
in my jurisdiction!

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:26.087
So give me an explanation
before you do anything else!

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:27.793
What are these things?

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:34.331
Mr. Kunikida.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:36.433
You at least know...

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:39.673
...what kind of group
the second division is, right?

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:43.274
There you go again,
making that scary face.

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:46.012
That's why your daughter
doesn't like you.

00:04:46.653 --> 00:04:47.984
I know what happened.

00:04:48.021 --> 00:04:51.115
You tried to take a bath
with Ruru

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:53.717
and she really railed against it.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.990
H-How do you know that?

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:59.897
Okay then,
gentlemen of the first division,

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.126
head on home!

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:02.600
W-Why you...

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:07.072
You don't want there
to be any more victims, do you?

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:21.776
Oh...

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:26.758
I didn't know that you were
a member of SpecSec.

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:29.523
So those really weren't
hallucinations, then.

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:32.992
Oh, I need to thank you
before I keep going.

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:34.966
You saved me, after all.

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:40.302
Oh, do you always use
that huge sword?

00:05:41.607 --> 00:05:43.234
This sword is the only thing

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:45.039
that can kill them, after all.

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.675
Them?

00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:50.376
Hey, rookie! What are you doing?
We're heading back!

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:51.883
Y-Yes, sir!

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:54.819
My name's Ranmaru Shindo.

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:55.843
Seeya!

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:56.980
Be careful.

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.490
Huh?

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:01.391
The survivors of Machida
are being hunted.

00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:03.019
Machida?

00:06:03.062 --> 00:06:04.461
Are you talking
about that incident?

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:06.556
What do you mean?
How do you know about that?

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:08.857
You don't remember?

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:10.960
We spoke once, a long time ago.

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:12.061
What?

00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:15.302
Hey, Shindo! Get a move on!

00:06:15.341 --> 00:06:16.330
Y-Yes, sir!

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:18.435
Do you want to be fired
from the Mobile Investigation Force?

00:06:32.558 --> 00:06:35.493
You're hungry, aren't you,
big brother?

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:37.826
Dinner will be ready soon.

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:41.964
What does it mean?

00:06:42.001 --> 00:06:45.300
How does she know about
what happened in Machida?

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:47.431
What in the world is SpecSec?

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.065
Big brother!

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:55.240
Oh, big brother... dinner!
Can't you hear me?

00:06:55.281 --> 00:06:56.748
Oh, dinner...

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:58.543
Tada!

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.916
To celebrate your first day
at your new post,

00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:04.946
I made my special niku jaga!

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:07.386
And I even cooked up
some steaks!

00:07:07.427 --> 00:07:09.054
Be sure to eat a whole bunch!

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:13.421
Ugh...

00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:16.629
Hey, what do you mean, 'ugh'?
How rude!

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:19.399
I-I'm telling you, there's no way
I can eat meat today!

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:20.872
You meanie!

00:07:20.907 --> 00:07:23.432
And after I went through all this
trouble to make you a feast!

00:07:23.476 --> 00:07:27.845
T-That's not it... O-Oh man...

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.177
bathroom... ugh...

00:07:29.215 --> 00:07:32.412
Jeez! Big brother!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.379
This is it!

00:07:39.225 --> 00:07:41.386
These are all photos taken
right after the incident.

00:07:43.496 --> 00:07:46.158
And this is a photo
from the most recent...

00:07:46.999 --> 00:07:48.466
Please take a close look.

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:49.235
Cannot be accessed

00:07:49.235 --> 00:07:49.769
Cannot be accessed
What's the meaning of this?

00:07:49.769 --> 00:07:51.396
What's the meaning of this?

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:53.098
What if you put the code in?

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:54.572
Cannot be accessed

00:07:54.607 --> 00:07:55.596
Security cannot be bypassed

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:57.006
Damn it!

00:07:57.043 --> 00:08:01.446
I cannot access any of the data
on those monsters.

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:03.972
And I'm afraid that all photos of when
the monsters appeared

00:08:04.016 --> 00:08:07.179
are like this, not just the ones
from this case.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:09.984
So someone is hiding them?

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.286
And on top of the evidence
being erased,

00:08:12.325 --> 00:08:16.989
all of the cases have been processed
as if they were normal murders.

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:18.994
Amazingly.

00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:20.760
You've got to be kidding me!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.360
How in the world could they
call that normal!?

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:26.530
I watched my subordinates
get torn apart by things

00:08:26.572 --> 00:08:29.507
with strange faces
on their bodies!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.738
It's only been a few years

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:34.746
since the Mobile Investigation Force
was originally formed...

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.772
...as a special organization
created to deal with the rapid rise

00:08:37.817 --> 00:08:41.810
of indiscriminate terrorist attacks
and atrocious crimes.

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:46.086
It was supposed to be a group
of expert criminal investigators,

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:49.891
but someone, somewhere,
is trying to limit our actions!

00:08:49.929 --> 00:08:51.453
Hmm...

00:08:51.497 --> 00:08:54.125
Do you remember the case
last month in Kamedo,

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:55.793
where a large number of people
were burned to death?

00:08:55.835 --> 00:08:57.268
Yeah.

00:08:57.303 --> 00:08:58.634
The one where a group of cultists

00:08:58.671 --> 00:09:00.298
killed themselves
or something, right?

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:02.170
That was the Jyouto Mobile
Investigation Force's

00:09:02.208 --> 00:09:04.267
jurisdiction, right?

00:09:04.944 --> 00:09:09.472
Actually, there was a witness
when that building was burning.

00:09:09.515 --> 00:09:10.675
A witness?

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:15.676
Officially, there were
no witnesses, but...

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:17.848
...there was a monster amongst
the flames,

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.824
eating a person.

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:21.349
What!?

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:24.329
There is also testimony stating
that they saw a demon.

00:09:24.363 --> 00:09:25.352
A demon?

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:27.298
This is from a different case, but...

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.634
Cannot be accessed

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:29.302
Cannot be accessed
For all of them, the crucial portions
cannot be accessed.

00:09:29.302 --> 00:09:32.203
For all of them, the crucial portions
cannot be accessed.

00:09:32.238 --> 00:09:34.229
The only common factor between all
of the cases

00:09:34.273 --> 00:09:35.672
is that right after they occurred,

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:39.166
the people from the second division
would always show up.

00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:41.338
Special Security Section, huh?

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:45.179
In actuality, the second division

00:09:45.217 --> 00:09:47.276
should be under the jurisdiction
of the Special Mobile Force.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.414
Speaking of which, they're supposed
to be Special Security!

00:09:50.456 --> 00:09:53.118
But they don't give a damn
about us!

00:09:53.159 --> 00:09:57.255
On top of that, their actions
go beyond the norm.

00:09:57.296 --> 00:09:58.320
Yeah.

00:09:58.364 --> 00:09:59.956
I mean, I had heard the rumors,

00:09:59.999 --> 00:10:01.398
but that's the first time

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:02.958
I had actually seen them
killing people.

00:10:03.002 --> 00:10:05.630
Those... might not
have been people, though.

00:10:06.806 --> 00:10:10.606
Muramasa! I want you
to investigate this thoroughly!

00:10:10.643 --> 00:10:13.134
What are those monsters, really?

00:10:13.179 --> 00:10:16.046
And what in the world are the guys
in SpecSec up to?

00:10:16.082 --> 00:10:17.276
Yes, sir!

00:10:17.316 --> 00:10:20.080
Damn that bitch...

00:10:20.119 --> 00:10:22.053
She'd better not think it's going
to stay like this!

00:10:25.124 --> 00:10:27.388
Where are we?

00:10:27.426 --> 00:10:28.984
What in the world am I?

00:10:33.566 --> 00:10:36.535
This couldn't be...

00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:46.500
What in the world are you doing
in a place like this?

00:10:50.216 --> 00:10:52.207
Who's that?

00:10:54.754 --> 00:10:57.222
Could it... be me?

00:11:02.662 --> 00:11:05.256
H-Hey! Behind you!

00:11:06.866 --> 00:11:08.060
Run!

00:11:09.201 --> 00:11:13.137
They're going to...
Hurry... hurry!

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:14.503
Run!

00:11:19.912 --> 00:11:21.174
Big brother...

00:11:21.213 --> 00:11:23.943
You dreamt about the naked woman
again, didn't you?

00:11:23.983 --> 00:11:25.883
T-That ain't it!

00:11:25.918 --> 00:11:28.148
That wasn't a woman.

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:29.677
She was around
elementary school age...

00:11:29.722 --> 00:11:31.656
Elementary school!?

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:33.090
Now you're dreaming of lolitas?

00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:34.560
You're perverted, big brother!

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.795
That's not it! I'm telling you
that you've got it wrong!
You're perverted, big brother!

00:11:35.795 --> 00:11:37.396
That's not it! I'm telling you
that you've got it wrong!
Oh, why you, pervert!

00:11:37.396 --> 00:11:40.263
She was wearing clothes.
Hey, calm down, Saya...
Oh, why you, pervert!

00:11:40.299 --> 00:11:41.926
Whoa!!

00:11:52.044 --> 00:11:55.013
Shindo?
Man, you're amazing.

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:58.574
When did you get so good
at shooting?

00:11:58.617 --> 00:12:01.518
Hanazono... I had it again...

00:12:01.554 --> 00:12:03.249
Had what?

00:12:03.289 --> 00:12:04.586
The dream.

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:06.181
Hmm?

00:12:06.225 --> 00:12:07.487
But I don't understand...

00:12:08.294 --> 00:12:12.094
It was definitely the apartment
complex in Machida, but...

00:12:12.131 --> 00:12:14.031
Why is she there?

00:12:14.066 --> 00:12:15.966
The girl in that dream...

00:12:16.001 --> 00:12:19.095
she looks like the one from the second
division that saved you, right?

00:12:19.138 --> 00:12:22.005
So, what were you two talking
about back then?

00:12:22.041 --> 00:12:23.030
Huh?

00:12:23.075 --> 00:12:24.406
Nothing...

00:12:24.443 --> 00:12:27.776
Nothing, huh?
Doesn't matter.

00:12:27.813 --> 00:12:30.611
You're getting all worked up,
aren't you?

00:12:30.649 --> 00:12:32.879
That's why you're having
weird dreams!

00:12:32.918 --> 00:12:35.512
Hurry up and find
a good woman!

00:12:35.554 --> 00:12:36.919
In that case,
on our next day off...

00:12:36.956 --> 00:12:39.948
...you should get ready
for a mixer!

00:12:39.992 --> 00:12:42.017
Yeah!

00:12:42.061 --> 00:12:43.756
That dream...

00:12:46.432 --> 00:12:47.729
Sakura Rokujo?

00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:48.756
Yeah!

00:12:48.801 --> 00:12:50.393
The girl from the second division?

00:12:50.436 --> 00:12:53.269
She's from the third term,
just like us!

00:12:54.507 --> 00:12:56.566
But she's different from us
somehow

00:12:56.609 --> 00:12:59.169
and she ended up
in the second division.

00:12:59.211 --> 00:13:01.907
Well, after seeing
what she did yesterday,

00:13:01.947 --> 00:13:03.915
it seems kind of obvious.

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:05.644
There's a rumor that says
that Kunikida

00:13:05.684 --> 00:13:08.278
was angry as all hell after that,
yesterday.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.617
He was all worked up, saying,

00:13:09.655 --> 00:13:12.021
"I'm definitely not going to let them
do whatever they want next time!"

00:13:12.057 --> 00:13:13.547
It looks like things are going to get
tougher from here out.

00:13:13.592 --> 00:13:14.616
Oh, I'm so scared.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:15.957
I don't want to get caught up
in that!

00:13:15.995 --> 00:13:18.463
Listen, about Rokujo...

00:13:18.497 --> 00:13:21.660
Yesterday, she said something
weird to me.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.395
Something weird?

00:13:23.435 --> 00:13:26.632
She said that the survivors of Machida
were being targeted...

00:13:26.672 --> 00:13:27.661
Now that you mention it,

00:13:27.706 --> 00:13:30.766
those monsters said something
like that, too.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.506
"Kill the survivors,"
or something like that.

00:13:33.546 --> 00:13:36.276
Machida, as in that case
from before?

00:13:36.315 --> 00:13:38.510
Yeah. That one happened
5 years ago.

00:13:40.519 --> 00:13:43.283
Well, that's something I don't want
to think about, you know?

00:13:43.322 --> 00:13:45.187
I mean, Machida!

00:13:45.224 --> 00:13:47.658
More importantly,
about that mixer...

00:13:47.693 --> 00:13:49.285
I found some cute girls!

00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:49.728
Really?

00:13:49.728 --> 00:13:50.329
Really?
Yeah, from the traffic division.

00:13:50.329 --> 00:13:51.227
Yeah, from the traffic division.

00:13:51.263 --> 00:13:51.730
Who?

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:52.231
Who?
I can't say.

00:13:52.231 --> 00:13:52.731
I can't say.

00:13:52.731 --> 00:13:53.666
Don't mess with me!

00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:54.300
Don't mess with me!
Just look forward to it!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.995
Just look forward to it!

00:13:56.836 --> 00:13:58.770
Odakyu Line / Machida Station

00:14:00.673 --> 00:14:03.801
It really has been a while since
I've come here, hasn't it?

00:14:05.377 --> 00:14:07.572
Not since that incident...

00:14:30.202 --> 00:14:34.502
Now then, how should I head in?

00:14:36.575 --> 00:14:39.009
I guess I'll try the front first.

00:14:40.212 --> 00:14:41.543
Hey there,
where are you going?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.548
I want to go inside.

00:14:43.582 --> 00:14:44.640
Why?

00:14:44.683 --> 00:14:46.947
I used to live here.

00:14:46.986 --> 00:14:48.510
It's nostalgic, you know?

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:50.146
This place is off limits!

00:14:50.189 --> 00:14:51.315
Why?

00:14:51.357 --> 00:14:52.790
Because there's the danger
of the place collapsing

00:14:52.825 --> 00:14:53.951
because of the earthquake.

00:14:53.993 --> 00:14:56.086
Collapse?

00:14:56.128 --> 00:14:59.188
This is an awful lot of security
just for that.

00:14:59.231 --> 00:15:00.425
And actually...

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.428
Well, take a look.

00:15:03.435 --> 00:15:04.925
Do you have a permit?

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:06.164
A permit?

00:15:06.205 --> 00:15:09.470
You need a special permit issued
by the government.

00:15:09.508 --> 00:15:11.567
I don't have anything like that.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:12.975
Then we can't let you through!

00:15:13.012 --> 00:15:14.707
Please go home!

00:15:14.747 --> 00:15:16.408
Don't be so strict.

00:15:16.448 --> 00:15:17.472
Leave!

00:15:18.484 --> 00:15:19.712
Tsk!

00:15:26.258 --> 00:15:29.455
That's not going
to drive me away.

00:15:29.495 --> 00:15:33.226
Oww! Well, it looks like this isn't
an electrified fence.

00:15:33.265 --> 00:15:34.254
Whoa!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.858
Oww...

00:15:35.901 --> 00:15:37.562
Damn it!

00:15:49.448 --> 00:15:50.642
This takes me back...

00:15:50.683 --> 00:15:54.346
When I was a kid,
I played here a lot... I think.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.804
Dad... Mom...

00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:17.130
Damn it!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.462
This is...

00:16:42.501 --> 00:16:43.934
Huh!?

00:16:57.716 --> 00:17:00.651
That's right, I remember...

00:17:00.686 --> 00:17:02.313
back then...

00:17:07.393 --> 00:17:11.591
You don't remember?
We spoke once, a long time ago.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.599
The survivors of Machida
are being hunted.

00:17:16.068 --> 00:17:17.626
Sakura Rokujo?

00:17:19.671 --> 00:17:22.538
That was her, back then...

00:17:24.843 --> 00:17:26.936
What in the world is this hole?

00:17:26.979 --> 00:17:29.641
I'm sure that back then...

00:17:54.006 --> 00:17:55.974
Chief...

00:17:56.008 --> 00:17:57.703
Hmm?

00:17:57.743 --> 00:17:58.937
What's this?

00:17:59.611 --> 00:18:00.600
It's the investigation materials

00:18:00.646 --> 00:18:02.944
that I was able to obtain
through certain sources.

00:18:03.682 --> 00:18:05.343
It would seem
that this is the suspect

00:18:05.384 --> 00:18:07.978
in the scattered body part
murder case.

00:18:09.021 --> 00:18:10.989
The suspect, you say?

00:18:11.023 --> 00:18:12.991
Are you saying this arm
killed them?

00:18:13.025 --> 00:18:16.927
No. There is no mistaking that the
owner of this arm is the culprit.

00:18:16.962 --> 00:18:19.157
I know that much!

00:18:19.198 --> 00:18:22.998
But it looks different
from the previous monsters...

00:18:23.035 --> 00:18:25.367
It appears that the owner
of this arm

00:18:25.404 --> 00:18:28.373
is somehow able
to control people.

00:18:28.407 --> 00:18:30.602
Control people?

00:18:30.642 --> 00:18:33.736
Are you saying that horror movie stuff
actually exists?

00:18:34.746 --> 00:18:37.806
Yes, it's hard to believe,

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.114
but I'm afraid that they might
have been controlled

00:18:40.152 --> 00:18:43.315
by those face-like things
that were attached to their bodies...

00:18:43.355 --> 00:18:46.483
Damn it, what are these things?

00:18:46.525 --> 00:18:49.289
I can't figure out why
this keeps happening?

00:18:49.328 --> 00:18:50.659
But to sum it all up,

00:18:50.696 --> 00:18:52.926
if we can catch the owner of this
demon hand,

00:18:52.965 --> 00:18:54.830
then we've got our culprit, right?

00:18:54.867 --> 00:18:58.667
Well, that is...
it's already been dealt with.

00:18:58.704 --> 00:19:00.171
Huh? What's that you say?

00:19:00.205 --> 00:19:04.073
Well, this appears to be a picture
of the part they cut off.

00:19:04.109 --> 00:19:06.805
Then who are you saying
took care of it?

00:19:08.881 --> 00:19:10.610
The SpecSec guys, huh?

00:19:11.884 --> 00:19:14.079
This is starting
to get interesting, isn't it?

00:19:14.119 --> 00:19:16.747
It looks like the thing
that we're chasing

00:19:16.788 --> 00:19:20.053
might be quite
the gruesome affair!

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:27.098
You sold it for that much?

00:19:27.132 --> 00:19:28.599
It was easy money.

00:19:28.634 --> 00:19:32.297
Well, it's been dangerous
to collect cans recently.

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:33.599
That's true.

00:19:33.639 --> 00:19:35.573
The government's been pretty
obnoxious, too...

00:19:40.078 --> 00:19:41.602
What are you supposed to be?

00:20:01.133 --> 00:20:02.725
W-What is this?

00:20:04.136 --> 00:20:05.971
Utagawa Precinct Office
Right, I understand.

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:07.097
Utagawa Precinct Office
We'll be there soon!

00:20:07.139 --> 00:20:09.607
Chief! It's Miyashita Park!

00:20:09.641 --> 00:20:11.074
All right! They've shown themselves.
Hurry up!

00:20:11.109 --> 00:20:12.098
Yes, sir!

00:20:12.144 --> 00:20:13.975
Hey, Shindo, Hanazono!

00:20:14.012 --> 00:20:15.013
Y-Yes, sir!

00:20:15.013 --> 00:20:16.014
Yes, sir!

00:20:16.014 --> 00:20:17.845
Come with me for a second!

00:20:17.883 --> 00:20:19.942
There's something I want you to bring
to the crime scene!

00:20:20.485 --> 00:20:21.611
What?

00:20:32.531 --> 00:20:34.726
Hey, what's the situation?

00:20:34.766 --> 00:20:35.824
Mr. Kunikida!

00:20:35.867 --> 00:20:38.529
It's no use. The guns have
absolutely no effect!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:41.266
I didn't think they would.
Hey! Bring that here!

00:20:41.306 --> 00:20:42.364
Yes, sir!

00:20:49.681 --> 00:20:51.012
All right, we can't let
these monsters

00:20:51.049 --> 00:20:52.380
just do whatever they want,
after all!

00:20:52.417 --> 00:20:54.282
M-Mr. Kunikida... is that...

00:20:54.319 --> 00:20:56.651
It's on loan from the impound.

00:20:56.688 --> 00:20:58.357
Tachikawa forever
T-The impound?

00:20:58.357 --> 00:20:59.654
Tachikawa forever
You can't possibly mean...

00:20:59.691 --> 00:21:03.388
Well, normal guns have no effect
on them, you know...

00:21:03.428 --> 00:21:05.658
That's why you have to be
this excessive!

00:21:05.697 --> 00:21:08.723
I-lf you fire something
like that in town,

00:21:08.767 --> 00:21:10.064
then a simple
written apology won't-

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:12.570
Quiet! Just shut up and watch!

00:21:12.604 --> 00:21:15.038
Don't mess with me!

00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:21.602
You bastards!

00:21:23.849 --> 00:21:26.579
And this is why former delinquents
are so much trouble!

00:21:26.618 --> 00:21:28.779
Damn it! So you've
shown yourselves, huh?

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:31.448
This is no place
for you SpecSec guys!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.151
Back off!

00:21:33.191 --> 00:21:36.786
The best way to kill those things
is with a sword...

00:21:36.828 --> 00:21:38.420
A hunter's sword!

00:21:50.008 --> 00:21:51.669
You understand now, right?

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.612
This isn't a case you ordinary people
can handle.

00:21:55.647 --> 00:21:56.636
Shut up!

00:21:56.682 --> 00:21:58.582
Muramasa! Quick,
go to the Self Defense Forces

00:21:58.617 --> 00:21:59.675
and bring back a tank!

00:21:59.718 --> 00:22:01.549
C-Chief, any more than this and...

00:22:01.586 --> 00:22:02.678
An attack chopper, too!

00:22:02.721 --> 00:22:03.813
But that's...

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.427
Sono te wo tsunaidari

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:51.402
Kuchizuke attari

00:22:51.436 --> 00:22:56.203
Ato sukoshi de sotto

00:22:56.241 --> 00:23:01.110
Saigo no hi ni naru

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.574
Wasurenai de douka
istumade mo

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.220
Sherry, far away

00:23:11.256 --> 00:23:13.656
Sherry kimi to

00:23:13.692 --> 00:23:18.595
Tada warai atta koto wo

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:20.996
Sherry, far away

00:23:21.032 --> 00:23:23.432
Sherry kimi to

00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:28.098
Dakishime atta koto wo

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.438
I sung the memories

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:32.966
Forever melodies

00:23:33.011 --> 00:23:35.241
I sung the memories

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:40.315
I sung the memories

00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:42.843
Forever melodies

00:23:42.888 --> 00:23:45.083
I sung the memories

00:23:48.126 --> 00:23:50.356
Sherry, far away

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:52.897
Sherry, far away

00:23:52.931 --> 00:23:59.962
I know you can find
my melodies

00:24:00.939 --> 00:24:03.942
Next Episode Preview

00:24:03.942 --> 00:24:05.877
Next Episode Preview
Eventually there will come a time
when you understand.

00:24:05.877 --> 00:24:06.400
Eventually there will come a time
when you understand.

00:24:07.279 --> 00:24:10.908
Tell me!
What in the world are they?

00:24:10.949 --> 00:24:12.746
What is it they want?

00:24:13.919 --> 00:24:15.045
The smell of the blood

00:24:15.086 --> 00:24:16.246
of brother and sister...

00:24:18.657 --> 00:24:21.023
On the next episode of Tokko,

00:24:21.927 --> 00:24:22.916
"Bonds".

